# Power BI — Measure Template
#
# Structural scaffold only. Copy into a model/measure doc and fill in the placeholders.
# No real business logic or data belongs in this template.

Measure name : <Business Friendly Name>        // e.g., Total Sales
Display folder: <Folder>                        // e.g., Sales \ Core
Format       : <format string>                  // e.g., #,0 ; $#,0.00 ; 0.0%
Purpose      : <what this measure answers, in business terms>
Depends on   : <tables/columns/measures referenced>

DAX:

<Measure Name> =
VAR __Base = <intermediate calculation>          -- use VAR for readability
VAR __Result = <final calculation using __Base>
RETURN
    __Result

Notes:
- <assumptions, filter context expectations, RLS interactions>
- <edge cases handled: blanks, first period, division by zero>
